    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Explore 69+ levels fully designed around speed-running through them in the most optimal time!</h2><strong>Share your <strong>Report Card</strong> of your feats!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS IS A SHORT GAME!</h2><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Gameplay Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> figure Out the Optimal Paths Through A Stage.<br></li><li> race Your Ghosts.<br></li><li> Do It Again Faster<br></li><li> Now Even Faster<br></li><li> find the developer's best time and gloat at them later.</li></ul><br>Designed from the perspective of what I thought a Sonic game would have played like if I never played or saw Sonic game.<br>I hope you like it.",
